=== MDV-P1-004
title: Solo doctor and clinic sign-up with the six-step onboarding wizard (autosave)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P1-E02
prd: P1-02
screens: F-04
priority: MUST
roles: Solo doctor, Practice owner
labels: onboarding
estimate: 3
weeks: 4-5
depends: MDV-P1-002
confidence: 85 | Hi-fi F-04 defines steps and fields for India and UAE; licence verification back-office flow is MDV-P1-007.
sources: design/Medvya Access and Onboarding (F-04); docs/02-design/screen-specs.md#f-04-solo-doctor-onboarding-6-steps-autosave
desc:
Steps: 1 Your profile · 2 Licence (council/authority, number, certificate upload; "Verification pending" notice) · 3 Clinic (name, address, CE reg./facility licence, GSTIN/TRN) · 4 Hours & fees · 5 Note templates (multi-select, used from P2/P3) · 6 Invite your team (optional). Progress autosaves; the user can leave and resume; "Finish · go to Today". Clinic mode supports several doctors and locations (owner who is not a doctor skips step 2).
ac:
- Each step validates per country (India council list/registration number; UAE DoH/DHA/MOHAP licence; GSTIN optional format check; TRN 15 digits) with errors shown under the field and announced via aria-live.
- Leaving mid-wizard and signing in again resumes at the same step with saved values.
- Until licence verification, the doctor can book and register patients; recording/signing capabilities are disabled with the designed notice (feature-level check, not just UI).
- Step 6 sends invitations through the P0 invitation flow (MDV-P0-013).
- Finishing lands on the role's home (Today for doctors, Front desk for owners/reception) and creates tenant, facility, membership, practice profile, hours and fee defaults.
- The whole wizard works at 768 px (tablet) and is keyboard-completable.

