- Open [PR #63](https://github.com/ALFRED-LUCIFER/medvya/pull/63): review fixes on the day grid — date steps from the date asked for (fast double click), sticky headers and time axis inside a focusable scroll region (RTL-safe), one offline banner, short unavailable blocks keep their reason, house ShellMessage, token colours with hatch contrast test, batched doctor names, type scale; mutation-checked; browser-verified (en, ar at an overflowing width, axe clean)
